            <div class=3D"code-head"><div><span class=3D"code-context">Crea=
r</span><span class=3D"code-file">Dockerfile =C2=B7 ra=C3=ADz del proyecto<=
/span></div><button class=3D"copy-btn" type=3D"button" aria-live=3D"polite"=
>Copiar</button></div>
            <pre class=3D"line-numbers language-docker" tabindex=3D"0"><cod=
